                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>The Gibraltar Chronicle of the 11th December has a supplement containing the
                    advertisement of the sale of the Sumter, as heretofore copied, with the addition
                    that “The above sale is postponed until Friday, the 19th instant.”</p>
